@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL11,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open04,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:可就在那个时候，<br>我中枪了。|#0103Trial13_Sherry003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR17,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:一颗子弹，<br>正中我的腿部。|#0103Trial13_Sherry004| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR5_1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:这……！<br>确实有这样的情况……！|#0103Trial13_Meruru001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR5_1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:今天早上，<br>雪莉小姐确实<br>在医务室……！|#0103Trial13_Meruru002| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR1_1,ArmL1,Eyes1_Pensive_Open2,Mouth1_Normal_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:她腿上有一处<br>非常严重的伤……！<br>血流个不停……！<br>|#0103Trial13_Meruru003| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR7,ArmL12,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:我本来想<br>自己止血的，<br>但效果不太理想呢！<br>|#0103Trial13_Sherry005| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Wink_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Yum_Closed
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:现在<br>光是站着<br>都很不容易☆|#0103Trial13_Sherry006| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Coco.Default,ArmR3,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Pensive_Open01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Pensive_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Coco Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:真假～？<br>你该不会<br>在演戏吧？|#0103Trial13_Coco001| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL4,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Smile_Closed01,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:想知道伤口有多深，<br>麻烦你问梅露露好啦～|#0103Trial13_Sherry007| RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Meruru.ArmR5_1,ArmL4,Eyes1_Normal_Open2,Mouth1_Angry_Open2
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left RollDirection:Right ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"确实……<br>照这个伤势看，<br>确实<link=\"Objection_01_03_13_01\">不太可能</link>。<br>就算能勉强走路，<br>但搬<link=\"Objection_01_03_13_02\">重物</link>应该真的不行……<br>我不觉得一个<link=\"Objection_01_03_13_03\">伤者</link><br>能做这么消耗体力的事……|#0103Trial13_Meruru004|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:70,50 Roll:4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR3,ArmL3,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open03,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Normal_Middle
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"换句话说，<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_04\">在凌晨1点后</link>，<br>我根本无法进行重体力劳动。<br>别说什么劳动了，<br>那时候我<br>还在生死边缘<br>挣扎呢……|#0103Trial13_Sherry008|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR2,ArmL2,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Normal_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Flushed_Open
@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Sherry Composition:Right RollDirection:Left ZoomLevel:3
@PrintDebateText Text:"而亚里沙听到<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_05\">巨大声响</link>的时间是<br><link=\"Objection_01_03_13_06\">【凌晨2点】</link>……<br>那时我正因为腿伤<br>痛得死去活来。<br>我怎么可能<br>有力气<link=\"Objection_01_03_13_07\">移动</link><br>整栋建筑物呢～|#0103Trial13_Sherry009|" RevealSpeed:1 ScenePosition:30,50 Roll:-4

; ＠備考◆達観したように穏やかな笑み。最後の「言いますか？」はシリアスさで大人っぽく。
@ModifyCharacterExtended Lazy:false IdAndAppearance:Sherry.Default,ArmR12,ArmL1,Angle01/Facial/Eyes>Eyes_Angry_Open02,Angle01/Facial/Mouth>Mouth_Smile_Closed
