@GosubToModifyPerspectiveStageCamera Index:0 LookCharacterId:Meruru Composition:Left
[PrintTextModified Text:光是站着就已经竭尽全力了。<br>我一直在想，为什么她没有立即来找我帮忙……|#0103Trial13_Meruru006| AuthorId:Meruru RevealSpeed:1 WaitForInput:true Wait:true]

